# Whether the built site embeds the full text of every captured snapshot.
#
# false (default, recommended for anything published): source pages show the
#   diffs, an excerpt, the hashes and a link to the original. Diffs and short
#   quotations are transformative and defensible; a full-text mirror of, say, a
#   Bitcoin Magazine article is a different proposition. The complete captures
#   stay in the local repo where they still back every claim.
#
# true: embeds complete snapshot bodies. Appropriate for a private or
#   access-gated deployment where the site IS the archive interface.
PUBLIC_FULL_TEXT=false

# Indexing is opt-in: builds are noindex,nofollow with a Disallow-all
# robots.txt unless this is exactly "true". `just publish` sets it together
# with SITE_URL=https://cc-vuln.org; preview builds leave it unset so a
# pages.dev deploy can never be indexed under a URL we do not intend to keep.
# (Read in src/layouts/Base.astro and src/pages/robots.txt.ts.)
PUBLIC_INDEXABLE=false
